sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Visitor
    participant SRV as /pricing (server page)
    participant PC as PricingPageClient
    participant TS as TrackSwitcher
    participant PS as PlanTermSelector (shared)
    participant GR as PricingTierGrid
    participant CT as PricingComparisonTable
    participant SC as startCheckout()
    participant API as POST /api/stripe/checkout
    participant REG as POST /api/auth/register
    participant MC as POST /api/account/marketing-consent
    participant DB as Postgres

    Note over U,DB: 1) Initial load — no page reload afterwards
    SRV->>SRV: getLandingContent() + getStarterPackContent()
    SRV-->>PC: content, starterPackItems
    PC->>PC: read ?track (default CAREER), ?plan, ?locked, ?cancelled
    PC->>PC: scroll to #plan-{plan} or #pricing if present
    PC->>TS: render(value = track)
    PC->>PS: render(value = term, showRate = false)
    PC->>GR: render(tiers = toLandingTiers(track), track, term, cadence)
    PC->>CT: render(groups, columns for track)
    Note over GR,CT: Prices derived: monthlyRateUsd / termTotalUsd / priceLabel

    Note over U,CT: 2) Track switch (Career <-> Sales)
    alt signed out (userTrack = null)
        U->>TS: click "Sales"
        TS->>PC: onChange("SALES")
        PC->>PC: setTrack("SALES")
        PC->>GR: re-render Sales tiers (Pro / Elite)
        PC->>CT: re-render Sales columns
    else signed in (userTrack set, R-1)
        Note over TS: switcher PINNED to userTrack; other segment disabled + lockedNote
        U->>TS: click other track
        TS-->>U: no-op ("Your account is on the Career track")
    end

    Note over U,CT: 3) Term toggle (Monthly <-> 12 + 2 free)
    U->>PS: click "12 + 2 free"
    PS->>PC: onChange("12")
    PC->>PC: setTerm("12")
    PC->>GR: paid cards show USD 16.29 (Career Pro) + "Save 14%"
    PC->>CT: header prices refresh

    Note over U,API: 4) Purchase CTA -> startCheckout()
    U->>GR: click "Get Started" (paid column)
    GR->>PC: onPurchase(plan, term, cadence)
    alt payments not live
        PC->>U: open ContactModal
    else signed out
        PC->>U: router.push(/signup?plan=&track=&callbackUrl=/pricing?track=)
    else signed in
        PC->>SC: startCheckout(plan, term, cadence)
        SC->>API: POST { plan, term, cadence }
        API->>DB: read User.track (server-authoritative)
        DB-->>API: track
        API-->>SC: { url }
        SC-->>PC: url
        PC->>U: window.location.href = url (Stripe Checkout)
    end

    Note over U,CT: 5) Starter (Career only)
    U->>GR: click "Join Free" (Starter column)
    GR->>PC: onStarterModal()
    PC->>U: open StarterPackModal

    Note over U,DB: 6) Signup consent (PR3)
    U->>PC: (via nav) /signup
    Note over U,REG: required Terms checkbox (*) + optional marketing checkbox
    U->>REG: POST /api/auth/register { termsAccepted:true, marketingConsent }
    alt termsAccepted !== true
        REG-->>U: 400 (z.literal(true) — required, R-2)
    else valid
        REG->>DB: INSERT User (tier STARTER, termsAcceptedAt=now, marketingConsent)
        REG-->>U: 201 -> auto sign-in -> /onboarding
    end

    Note over U,DB: 7) Login marketing opt-in (PR3, R-4)
    U->>PC: (via nav) /login, tick "send me marketing"
    PC->>PC: signIn() succeeds
    alt box ticked (opt-in only)
        PC->>MC: POST { consent: true }  (requires session)
        MC->>DB: UPDATE User (marketingConsent=true, marketingConsentAt=now)
        MC->>DB: UPSERT EmailSubscriber (subscribed=true)
        MC-->>PC: { ok: true }
    else box unticked
        Note over PC: no-op — never revokes existing consent
    end
